   "id": 1,
   "plugin": "Core",
   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "EMOTIONAL ROAD\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 11, CC 33 to 48\n   1 Where this character is on their road\n   2 Where the film is on its road\n   3 Does the feeling turn\n   4 Hidden to shown\n   5 How far the feeling spreads\n   6 Catharsis\n   7 Feeling held in\n   8 Hope\n   9 What they stand to lose\n  10 Breather\n  11 False high, false low\n  12 Two roads\n  13 A feeling comes back\n  14 Warmth between two\n  15 Dread\n  16 On their side, or against them\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 11, CC 49 to 64\n   1 Nostalgia\n   2 Longing\n   3 Guilt\n   4 Earned tears\n   5 Cool or warm telling\n   6 Feeling left when the film ends\n   7 Grief\n   8 Loneliness\n   9 Betrayal\n  10 Forgiveness\n  11 Resentment\n  12 suite: Emotional road lens\n  13 suite: Rock bottom\n  14 suite: Hope dies\n  15 suite: The midpoint win\n  16 suite: A rest stop\nCV-CC 3: MIDI channel 11, CC 65 to 80\n   1 suite: Crossed roads\n   2 suite: The old song\n   3 suite: Slow dread\n   4 suite: Everything to lose\n   5 suite: Earned release\n   6 suite: Tearjerker finale\n   7 suite: Slow-burn grudge\n   8 suite: Bittersweet ending\n   9 suite: Cold and distant\n  10 suite: Lonely heart\n  11 suite: A guilty conscience\n  12 suite: Stab in the back\n  13 suite: Making peace\n  14 suite: Rose-tinted past\n  15 suite: Rooting for the wrong one\n  16 pair: When a character reaches their lowest point, their feeling turns\nCV-CC 4: MIDI channel 11, CC 81 to 96\n   1 pair: After a low scene, a laugh\n   2 pair: A hidden feeling bursts out later\n   3 pair: After tension peaks, release follows\n   4 pair: When enough feeling is held in, it comes out\n   5 pair: When a false high peaks, the fall follows\n   6 pair: When a big feeling peaks, a breather follows\n   7 pair: When the stakes rise, hope gets fragile\n   8 pair: When hope is lost, the release comes later\n   9 pair: When an old feeling comes back changed, the release arrives\n  10 pair: When dread builds, the music thins out\n  11 pair: When the warmth cools, the two roads part\n  12 pair: When the dread is lifted, a laugh comes\n  13 pair: When dread builds, a character's attention starts narrowing\n  14 pair: When we feel with them, their tears feel earned\n  15 pair: When we turn against them, we stop feeling with them\n  16 pair: When they show gentle care, we take their side\nCV-CC 5: MIDI channel 11, CC 97 to 112\n   1 pair: When an old tune returns, nostalgia comes with it\n   2 pair: When nostalgia rises, the color warms\n   3 pair: When the past calls, longing grows\n   4 pair: When longing grows, loneliness follows\n   5 pair: When loneliness grows, the frame empties around them\n   6 pair: When loneliness grows, the music falls away\n   7 pair: When guilt grows, they hold more in\n   8 pair: When guilt grows, words stop matching meaning\n   9 pair: When jealousy lingers, it hardens into a grudge\n  10 pair: When the tears are earned, the release arrives\n  11 pair: When the telling turns ice cold, we feel less with them\n  12 pair: When the telling warms, the camera moves closer\n  13 pair: When the big release comes, the ending stays with us\n  14 pair: When an old feeling comes back, the ending lingers longer\n  15 pair: When hope is lost, grief sets in\n  16 pair: When grief is heavy, a laugh slips in\nCV-CC 6: MIDI channel 12, CC 1 to 15\n   1 pair: When they are betrayed, the warmth goes cold\n   2 pair: When they are betrayed, a grudge takes root\n   3 pair: When the grudge nears boiling, anger breaks out\n   4 pair: When they forgive, the warmth comes back\n   5 pair: When they forgive, the big release comes\n   6 pairs: Emotional rollercoaster\n   7 pairs: The dam breaks\n   8 pairs: The fall and the rise\n   9 pairs: Breathing room\n  10 pairs: The pressure cooker\n  11 pairs: From loss to letting go\n  12 pairs: Betrayed, then forgiven\n  13 pairs: Getting it off their chest\n  14 pairs: The ache of missing\n  15 pairs: Earning the tears"
   },
